RipsMath_DeriveCoprimeA
├── when the random value mod n is zero
│   └── it should return one.
├── when the random value mod n is even
│   └── it should return the value plus one.
├── when the random value mod n is odd
│   └── it should return the value unchanged.
├── when the random value is zero
│   └── it should return one.
├── when the random value is type(uint256).max
│   └── it should return an odd number.
└── when the random value is type(uint256).max minus one
    └── it should return an odd number.
